context/briefing.md
# What is dropped for an agent (screenshots, dragged files): machine-specific.
inbox/attachments/*
!inbox/attachments/.gitkeep
# Each user's personal notes on the studio (identity, goals, preferences).
context/identity.md
context/goals.md
context/preferences.md
